                    <span id="lblMinimumReqsInClassSpec">You will find the Minimum Requirements in the Class Specification.</span><ul><li><a href='https://hrnet.calhr.ca.gov/CalHRNet/SpecCrossReference.aspx?ClassID=5393' target='_blank'>ASSOCIATE GOVERNMENTAL PROGRAM ANALYST</a></li><li><a href='https://hrnet.calhr.ca.gov/CalHRNet/SpecCrossReference.aspx?ClassID=5157' target='_blank'>STAFF SERVICES ANALYST</a></li></ul>
                </div>
            

