                <ul><li><a href='http://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Jobs/JobApplicationPackageChecklist.aspx?JobControlId=462791'>Job Application Package Checklist</a></li><li><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=26473207&name=530-001-5393-709and530-001-5157-709DutyStatement.pdf'>Duty Statement</a></li></ul>

